    <preface>
      <p>Customs Tariff Amendment (Carbon Tax Repeal) Act 2014</p>
      <p>No. 86, 2014</p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Customs Tariff Act 1995</i>, and for related purposes</p>
      <p>Contents</p>
      <p>1	Short title	1</p>
      <p>2	Commencement	2</p>
      <p>3	Schedule(s)	2</p>
      <p>Schedule 1—Amendments	3</p>
      <p><ref href="#part-1">Part 1</ref>—General amendments	3</p>
      <p>Customs Tariff Act 1995	3</p>
      <p><ref href="#part-2">Part 2</ref>—Gasoline for use as fuel in aircraft	4</p>
